3. Probation
3.2 Restrictions during probation
Employees on probation:
- may take at most 3 days of annual leave during their first 3 months (see the Leave Policy);
- are not eligible for fully remote arrangements or sabbaticals;
- are not eligible for internal transfers;
- have a notice period of 30 days.
Maternity leave pauses the probation clock.

